---
import { BOOKING_URL } from '@/config/site';
import Stats from './Stats.astro';
---

<section
  class="mx-auto grid max-w-container gap-16 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:gap-24 md:px-16 md:py-28"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <p
      class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-accent"
    >
      ↳ ENGENHARIA DE DADOS &amp; IA
    </p>

    <h1
      class="font-serif text-[clamp(40px,7vw,76px)] leading-[0.98] text-ink"
    >
      A coluna<br />
      vertebral dos<br />
      <em class="italic">seus dados.</em>
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-[560px] font-sans text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Construímos sistemas de dados, agentes de IA e automações com rigor de
      engenharia. Resultado de negócio sustentado por arquitetura técnica.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
      <a
        href={BOOKING_URL}
        class="inline-flex h-[46px] w-[240px] items-center justify-center bg-ink font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-canvas transition-colors hover:bg-accent"
      >
        AGENDAR DIAGNÓSTICO ↗
      </a>
      <a
        href="#metodologia"
        class="inline-flex h-[46px] w-[200px] items-center justify-center border border-ink font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-canvas"
      >
        VER METODOLOGIA
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="md:self-end md:pb-2">
    <Stats />
  </aside>
</section>
